
Bug found and fixed September 9-11 2026.

Kaixuan Li provided git Pull Request #325.

We separated the original testcase
submission into a build and a test
C source, and save the proof binaries
as *.poc files here.

We find it convenient to run both the
original test program as well as running
dwarfdump.  The dwarfdump  run on on the 64 case
with a -fsanitize build shows a definitive
error before the fix and shows sensible
behavior after the fix.

